.DS_Store

# justfile が dotenv として読む。ローカルの絶対パスやトークンが入りうる。
.env
.env.local
console/node_modules/
console/frontend/node_modules/
.overlord/

# This repository's own working board. Overlord rewrites it whenever it runs
# against this repository, and it records local directory paths and cmux
# session ids. The tracked template is docs/product-ops/board.example.yaml.
docs/product-ops/board.yaml

# board.yaml write path: the cross-process lock and the atomic-rename staging
# files, neither of which ever outlives a write.
board.yaml.lock
*.overlord-tmp.*
